WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration.

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse.

4
01:37.759 --> 01:39.440
Nuannuan, come eat some meat.

5
01:40.960 --> 01:41.890
It's delicious.

6
01:42.440 --> 01:43.440
Auntie, look.

7
01:43.440 --> 01:44.920
This is Mom and Dad.

8
01:44.920 --> 01:46.479
This is you and Uncle.

9
01:46.560 --> 01:49.039
And the one in the middle is me.

10
01:49.840 --> 01:50.680
Awesome.

11
01:50.680 --> 01:52.560
You draw so well, Nuannuan.

12
01:52.560 --> 01:54.560
This drawing is quite creative.

13
01:54.680 --> 01:56.400
She made you look quite handsome.

14
01:56.400 --> 01:57.039
Really?

15
01:57.320 --> 01:59.479
Of course. Uncle is very handsome.

16
01:59.479 --> 02:00.560
Even more handsome than Dad.

17
02:00.560 --> 02:02.760
Let me see who is more handsome than Dad.

18
02:02.920 --> 02:04.440
Children have sharp eyes.

19
02:06.120 --> 02:08.560
Nuannuan's drawing is even better than last time.

20
02:08.560 --> 02:09.840
She really has a lot of talent.

21
02:09.840 --> 02:10.440
Nuannuan,

22
02:10.600 --> 02:12.560
how about Mommy finds you an art teacher?

23
02:12.560 --> 02:13.400
You can become

24
02:13.400 --> 02:15.660
a very, very great painter in the future.

25
02:18.240 --> 02:20.640
Becoming a great painter is not important.

26
02:20.720 --> 02:21.760
As long as Nuannuan is happy.

27
02:21.760 --> 02:22.800
We can draw if we want to,

28
02:22.800 --> 02:24.079
and not draw if we don't want to.

29
02:24.079 --> 02:24.480
Right? Right.

30
02:24.480 --> 02:25.079
Cheng Fei.

31
02:25.079 --> 02:26.410
Yes, Nuannuan is right.

32
02:26.640 --> 02:30.040
The most important thing is for the family to be happy, right?

33
02:30.800 --> 02:32.079
Shall we make a toast?

34
02:32.079 --> 02:35.360
Cheers. Being happy is the most important thing.

35
02:36.840 --> 02:38.840
Can we come out and play more often?

36
02:38.840 --> 02:40.000
Of course we can.

37
02:45.680 --> 02:46.440
What does Nuannuan want to eat?

38
02:46.440 --> 02:47.840
Daddy will get it for you.

39
02:48.280 --> 02:49.040
I want to eat that.

40
02:49.040 --> 02:50.040
That one? Okay.

41
03:27.600 --> 03:31.160
How did I do as a cardboard cutout today?

42
03:32.880 --> 03:34.880
What do you mean, cardboard cutout?

43
03:36.200 --> 03:38.400
I just wanted to hang out with you.

44
03:38.600 --> 03:40.120
You're so paranoid.

45
03:40.200 --> 03:41.130
What's going on?

46
03:44.160 --> 03:46.480
They're having relationship problems, aren't they?

47
03:46.480 --> 03:47.400
How bad is it?

48
03:50.400 --> 03:51.840
There's no proof of that.

49
03:51.840 --> 03:53.640
Why are you making wild guesses?

50
03:53.800 --> 03:55.320
Just tell me, did you have fun?

51
03:55.320 --> 03:56.180
Were you happy?

52
03:56.200 --> 03:57.880
Did you enjoy the barbecue?

53
03:58.400 --> 03:59.120
I had fun.

54
03:59.400 --> 04:00.120
I was happy.

55
04:00.200 --> 04:01.520
The meat was delicious too.

56
04:01.520 --> 04:03.320
Bring your uncle out more often.

57
04:04.600 --> 04:07.040
What, are you addicted?

58
04:08.000 --> 04:10.040
Kids have no filter.

59
04:10.040 --> 04:11.320
Are you a kid too?

60
04:12.640 --> 04:14.040
Just focus on driving.

61
04:14.760 --> 04:16.089
What are you looking at?

62
04:17.480 --> 04:19.399
Well, I'm gonna take a quick nap.

63
04:20.040 --> 04:20.700
I'm sleepy.

64
04:44.600 --> 04:45.320
Master.

65
04:45.720 --> 04:46.440
This lumbar cushion

66
04:46.440 --> 04:48.600
can support your lower back

67
04:48.720 --> 04:50.180
and relieve the pressure.

68
04:50.200 --> 04:50.760
Try it.

69
04:51.120 --> 04:51.720
Thank you.

70
04:51.880 --> 04:54.320
But I'm not really used to it.

71
04:54.600 --> 04:56.040
Then you should definitely try it.

72
04:56.040 --> 04:57.320
You'll get used to it.

73
04:57.320 --> 04:58.920
Trust me, you can't go wrong.

74
04:59.720 --> 05:00.650
Okay, thank you.

75
05:01.880 --> 05:02.640
Master,

76
05:03.760 --> 05:06.160
how did you hurt your lower back?

77
05:08.920 --> 05:10.440
I spoke out of turn. Sorry.

78
05:11.080 --> 05:12.440
You should take care of your health

79
05:12.440 --> 05:13.440
and strike a balance between work and rest.

80
05:13.440 --> 05:14.240
I'm going out.

81
05:19.560 --> 05:21.560
I don't know what's wrong with my back lately.

82
05:21.560 --> 05:22.560
It hurts so much.

83
05:24.440 --> 05:25.000
Chao.

84
05:25.320 --> 05:27.040
Rub it for me. Come on.

85
05:28.040 --> 05:28.880
It hurts.

86
05:30.160 --> 05:31.490
Does your back hurt too?

87
05:32.320 --> 05:33.280
That lumbar cushion works really well.

88
05:33.280 --> 05:34.440
I'll send you a link.

89
05:37.480 --> 05:38.240
Thank you.

90
05:38.600 --> 05:40.600
Bowen, I know an old Chinese medicine doctor.

91
05:40.600 --> 05:41.840
It's awesome.

92
05:42.080 --> 05:43.920
Do you want me to push it over to you?

93
05:43.920 --> 05:44.760
No need.

94
05:45.320 --> 05:46.720
You massage really well.

95
06:15.120 --> 06:16.320
Hello, Jia'er.

96
06:16.320 --> 06:17.320
How have you been lately?

97
06:17.320 --> 06:17.800
Well,

98
06:17.800 --> 06:20.000
could you recommend a marriage counseling service to me?

99
06:20.000 --> 06:20.800
I want to give it a try.

100
06:20.800 --> 06:22.400
I'll find some professional ones later

101
06:22.400 --> 06:23.320
and send them to you.

102
06:23.320 --> 06:24.320
They should be able to help you.

103
06:24.320 --> 06:25.080
Thanks.

104
06:26.480 --> 06:27.560
I plan to ask the company

105
06:27.560 --> 06:29.120
for all the annual leave

106
06:29.120 --> 06:30.800
I haven't taken in the past two years.

107
06:30.800 --> 06:32.680
Besides this marriage counseling,

108
06:32.680 --> 06:35.240
I also want to take them on a trip to Iceland.

109
06:35.240 --> 06:35.960
Yeah,

110
06:36.320 --> 06:37.400
you do need to relax

111
06:37.400 --> 06:38.680
and get a change of scenery.

112
06:38.680 --> 06:40.159
That's it for now. Bye.

113
06:46.440 --> 06:47.200
Come on.

114
06:47.880 --> 06:49.440
We're home.

115
06:51.360 --> 06:52.890
What do you want for dinner?

116
06:53.440 --> 06:54.560
Anything is fine.

117
06:56.560 --> 06:58.290
Playing as soon as you get back.

118
06:58.560 --> 07:01.000
Your mom will definitely scold you if she sees you.

119
07:01.000 --> 07:02.680
Dad, don't worry.

120
07:02.800 --> 07:05.560
Mom never comes back before dark.

121
07:05.640 --> 07:08.880
She's always busy, busy, busy.

122
07:08.880 --> 07:10.200
You smart little thing.

123
07:10.200 --> 07:11.200
Drink your water.

124
07:15.160 --> 07:16.290
You're early today.

125
07:18.320 --> 07:20.080
I took annual leave from work.

126
07:21.560 --> 07:22.320
Nuannuan,

127
07:23.240 --> 07:25.440
how about Dad and I take you out to play?

128
07:25.440 --> 07:26.320
Really?

129
07:26.320 --> 07:26.880
Yes, really.

130
07:26.880 --> 07:29.760
Let's take some time off school and go out to play, okay?

131
07:29.760 --> 07:30.760
Awesome!

132
07:32.560 --> 07:35.960
Why are you playing on the tablet again as soon as you get back?

133
07:37.800 --> 07:38.600
Then you can

134
07:39.400 --> 07:40.480
play for another fifteen minutes.

135
07:40.480 --> 07:41.240
Okay.

136
07:43.760 --> 07:45.880
Haven't you always wanted to go to Iceland?

137
07:45.880 --> 07:48.200
I just finalized things with the travel agency today.

138
07:48.200 --> 07:49.240
We'll leave in a week.

139
07:49.240 --> 07:50.000
First, we'll go to Iceland.

140
07:50.000 --> 07:51.000
We'll stay there for a week.

141
07:51.000 --> 07:52.720
Then we'll head to Norway.

142
07:52.720 --> 07:54.000
After four days in Norway,

143
07:54.000 --> 07:55.560
we'll spend two days in Finland.

144
07:55.560 --> 07:57.159
And in Finland, we'll take...

145
07:57.159 --> 07:58.240
Zhao Jia.

146
08:00.320 --> 08:02.240
There's something I want to tell you.

147
08:02.240 --> 08:02.770
Go ahead.

148
08:05.560 --> 08:06.760
Let me take this call.

149
08:08.760 --> 08:09.240
Hello?

150
08:09.800 --> 08:10.240
Hello.

151
08:10.360 --> 08:11.360
Is this Zhao Jia?

152
08:11.560 --> 08:12.220
Who is this?

153
08:12.320 --> 08:14.320
I'm calling from the Anping District People's Court.

154
08:14.320 --> 08:15.800
Your husband, Cheng Fei, just filed

155
08:15.800 --> 08:17.130
a petition for divorce.

156
08:17.400 --> 08:18.600
According to the law,

157
08:18.600 --> 08:20.920
we need to arrange a pre-litigation mediation.

158
08:20.920 --> 08:22.850
I'd like to check the time with you.

159
08:29.400 --> 08:30.200
What did I say?

160
08:30.400 --> 08:31.960
Didn't I say it was a big client?

161
08:31.960 --> 08:33.220
Am I sensitive or what?

162
08:33.320 --> 08:33.960
I'm telling you, sometimes

163
08:33.960 --> 08:35.640
I even suspect I have some kind of sixth sense.

164
08:35.640 --> 08:36.200
Still want to argue?

165
08:36.200 --> 08:37.080
No more arguing.

166
08:37.080 --> 08:37.880
You win.

167
08:38.080 --> 08:39.840
Our opponent this time is Lawyer Li again.

168
08:39.840 --> 08:41.080
Then we're bound to win.

169
08:41.080 --> 08:42.679
That suitcase doesn't understand human nature at all.

170
08:42.679 --> 08:43.640
When it comes to emotions,

171
08:43.640 --> 08:44.440
he's way behind.

172
08:44.440 --> 08:45.840
Way behind who?

173
08:45.840 --> 08:46.640
Me, of course.

174
08:46.840 --> 08:49.160
Then, relationship expert, analyze this for us.

175
08:49.160 --> 08:51.200
Why is Cheng Fei so determined to get a divorce?

176
08:51.200 --> 08:52.960
That's so simple.

177
08:52.960 --> 08:53.880
Think about it.

178
08:53.960 --> 08:56.200
If a man is so determined to get a divorce,

179
08:56.200 --> 08:57.800
he definitely has someone else lined up.

180
08:57.800 --> 08:59.400
Otherwise, he wouldn't be so motivated.

181
08:59.400 --> 09:00.600
I've seen this kind of thing a lot.

182
09:00.600 --> 09:02.760
No, you have to look on the bright side.

183
09:02.760 --> 09:04.160
Maybe he has a terminal illness

184
09:04.160 --> 09:05.960
and doesn't want to burden his wife and child.

185
09:05.960 --> 09:06.520
Miao,

186
09:06.520 --> 09:07.780
watch fewer TV dramas.

187
09:08.160 --> 09:10.160
It's also possible that, like Gauguin,

188
09:10.160 --> 09:11.640
he suddenly went to find himself.

189
09:11.640 --> 09:12.400
Makes sense.

190
09:12.960 --> 09:13.880
Who is Gauguin?

191
09:14.440 --> 09:15.440
A painter.

192
09:16.160 --> 09:18.220
'The Moon and Sixpence' is about him.

193
09:18.600 --> 09:19.160
This... this...

194
09:19.160 --> 09:20.840
I've read this Sixpence thing.

195
09:20.840 --> 09:21.760
Isn't it in the same series

196
09:21.760 --> 09:22.840
as Grimm's Fairy Tales?

197
09:22.840 --> 09:24.240
Written by Grimm, right?

198
09:24.960 --> 09:25.640
Right?

199
09:25.880 --> 09:26.720
Alright.

200
09:26.920 --> 09:29.640
Since we don't understand, let's figure it out.

201
09:30.200 --> 09:30.930
Understood.

202
09:35.400 --> 09:36.400
Let's go. What are you doing?

203
09:36.400 --> 09:37.720
Let's go investigate.

204
09:38.920 --> 09:39.640
Let's go.

205
09:40.520 --> 09:41.640
Say something, Uncle.

206
09:41.640 --> 09:42.880
No, just think about it.

207
09:42.880 --> 09:43.880
What could this mean?

208
09:43.880 --> 09:45.010
I... I didn't see it.

209
09:52.200 --> 09:52.840
How is it?

210
09:53.520 --> 09:56.050
Much better, but it still seems a bit swollen.

211
10:15.640 --> 10:16.500
Take a picture.

212
10:24.560 --> 10:25.640
Did you have fun today?

213
10:25.640 --> 10:26.400
Yes.

214
10:26.400 --> 10:27.520
I had an art class.

215
10:29.880 --> 10:32.340
Did the teacher tell you to drink more water?

216
10:34.120 --> 10:34.850
How did it go?

217
10:34.880 --> 10:36.140
Did you find anything?

218
10:36.720 --> 10:39.250
I found that Cheng Fei is indeed a good doctor.

219
10:39.440 --> 10:40.640
And a good father too.

220
10:41.440 --> 10:44.000
Why did such a good man have to get a divorce?

221
10:44.120 --> 10:44.920
I don't get it.

222
10:47.040 --> 10:47.560
Uncle.

223
10:48.000 --> 10:49.080
Li, Li, Li...

224
10:49.480 --> 10:50.600
Lawyer Li is here.

225
10:50.600 --> 10:51.840
So what if he's here? Why are you yelling?

226
10:51.840 --> 10:52.720
Are you crazy?

227
10:52.720 --> 10:54.720
Cheng Fei is starting to touch Li Lv.

228
11:06.960 --> 11:08.420
What's going on with them?

229
11:15.360 --> 11:17.360
For your previously injured area,

230
11:18.240 --> 11:20.240
you need to do more strength training.

231
11:20.240 --> 11:20.720
You're always like this.

232
11:20.720 --> 11:22.720
How can you be okay if it never heals?

233
11:22.720 --> 11:23.520
It's been so many years.

234
11:23.520 --> 11:24.650
It's an old problem.

235
11:24.960 --> 11:26.360
You have to do McKenzie exercises every day.

236
11:26.360 --> 11:27.240
Do ten sets.

237
11:38.360 --> 11:39.840
Stop working. Let's eat.

238
11:41.000 --> 11:43.000
You go ahead. I'll work a bit longer.

239
11:46.360 --> 11:48.290
That suitcase was damaged before.

240
11:49.480 --> 11:50.410
How did you know?

241
11:50.720 --> 11:53.180
I went to Cheng Fei's and saw him doing rehab.

242
11:54.320 --> 11:55.580
How did he get injured?

243
11:55.760 --> 11:57.290
It happened a long time ago.

244
11:58.080 --> 11:59.680
Why do you care so much about him?

245
11:59.680 --> 12:00.600
Just curious.

246
12:00.800 --> 12:02.080
Ask him if you're so curious.

247
12:02.080 --> 12:03.440
Why would I ask him?

248
12:09.960 --> 12:12.400
Then let me ask you a personal question.

249
12:16.440 --> 12:17.200
Ask away.

250
12:19.600 --> 12:21.400
What's going on between you two?

251
12:23.040 --> 12:24.680
That's way too personal.

252
12:24.680 --> 12:27.680
We're just chatting. What's the big deal? We're bros.

253
12:31.800 --> 12:33.560
Like I care. You two...

254
12:35.440 --> 12:35.680
What's going on?

255
12:35.680 --> 12:37.540
Come here and take a look. Come on.

256
12:44.560 --> 12:46.320
Look. Look at those eyes.

257
12:47.040 --> 12:48.040
Look at this hand.

258
12:49.560 --> 12:51.080
Am I being too sensitive?

259
12:51.680 --> 12:52.400
No.

260
12:53.200 --> 12:55.060
Actually, it's understandable.

261
12:58.600 --> 13:00.320
Human emotions are fluid.

262
13:08.560 --> 13:10.560
Why is he acting so weird lately?

263
13:31.560 --> 13:33.080
These are the new short-sleeved shirts in our store.

264
13:33.080 --> 13:34.480
They are all 100% cotton.

265
13:35.080 --> 13:36.960
Do you have this in a hardshell?

266
13:36.960 --> 13:38.320
Like, with better quality.

267
13:38.320 --> 13:40.120
Then let's take a look over here.

268
13:40.200 --> 13:41.920
He can wear it as casual clothes for commuting.

269
13:41.920 --> 13:43.440
It depends on what your boyfriend needs.

270
13:43.440 --> 13:45.440
Usually, he wears white to work.

271
13:46.080 --> 13:47.080
I'll take this one.

272
13:47.080 --> 13:47.920
Okay.

273
13:49.920 --> 13:51.160
Let me confirm one last time

274
13:51.160 --> 13:53.200
if there is any room for compromise between both parties.

275
13:53.200 --> 13:53.840
No.

276
13:54.240 --> 13:54.920
No.

277
13:55.160 --> 13:56.960
Due to the intense conflict between both parties,

278
13:56.960 --> 13:58.440
this court will no longer mediate

279
13:58.440 --> 14:00.570
and will proceed to the trial process.

280
14:06.800 --> 14:07.600
Cheng Fei.

281
14:10.240 --> 14:12.300
You have so many complaints about me.

282
14:12.440 --> 14:14.280
Why didn't you usually communicate with me?

283
14:14.280 --> 14:15.280
What's the point?

284
14:15.440 --> 14:17.370
Neither of us can change the other.

285
14:18.720 --> 14:20.180
Stop making a scene, okay?

286
14:20.200 --> 14:22.920
Let's go home. We can solve the problems, okay?

287
14:23.680 --> 14:24.960
We are no longer suited

288
14:24.960 --> 14:26.440
to live together.

289
14:29.520 --> 14:31.400
More than ten years together.

290
14:31.960 --> 14:33.400
You just say we're not suited and that's it?

291
14:33.400 --> 14:35.040
Have you ever respected me?

292
14:35.440 --> 14:36.680
Let's not talk about it here.

293
14:36.680 --> 14:37.920
It's embarrassing for everyone.

294
14:37.920 --> 14:39.320
Who is embarrassing who now?

295
14:39.320 --> 14:41.650
You're the one insisting on this divorce.

296
14:41.800 --> 14:43.320
More than ten years.

297
14:43.840 --> 14:46.600
Can you just say you don't want this anymore?

298
14:46.600 --> 14:48.680
Why do I find that so hard to believe, Cheng Fei?

299
14:48.680 --> 14:50.680
Cheng Fei, tell me. What did I do wrong?

300
14:50.680 --> 14:52.560
Why do you insist on a divorce?

301
14:52.720 --> 14:53.320
Cheng Fei.

302
14:57.560 --> 14:58.720
Just tell the truth.

303
15:06.720 --> 15:08.520
I fell in love with someone else.

304
15:10.280 --> 15:12.400
I think she can give me the life I want.

305
15:13.920 --> 15:15.780
But we are just friends right now.

306
15:15.960 --> 15:18.290
I want to sort out our relationship first.

307
15:25.960 --> 15:27.890
You fell in love with someone else.

308
15:30.600 --> 15:32.960
You should have told me earlier if you fell in love with someone else.

309
15:32.960 --> 15:33.560
If you had told me earlier,

310
15:33.560 --> 15:35.290
I would have let you go earlier.

311
15:36.720 --> 15:37.680
Why are you pretending?

312
15:37.680 --> 15:38.440
Zhao Jia.

313
15:39.080 --> 15:40.280
Except for Nuannuan,

314
15:41.560 --> 15:42.960
I don't want anything else.

315
15:42.960 --> 15:43.890
As for Nuannuan,

316
15:45.520 --> 15:48.050
you will never take her away in this lifetime.

317
16:00.240 --> 16:02.900
You should have told Zhao Jia the truth earlier.

318
16:03.160 --> 16:04.640
I didn't want to upset her.

319
16:06.360 --> 16:08.240
Our divorce is between us.

320
16:08.240 --> 16:10.300
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

321
16:11.000 --> 16:13.520
But the moment you had someone else in your heart,

322
16:13.520 --> 16:15.000
hurt was inevitable.

323
16:23.480 --> 16:25.120
I searched the whole house.

324
16:25.120 --> 16:27.780
But I just couldn't find that divorce judgment.

325
16:28.160 --> 16:29.520
The court doesn't have it either.

326
16:29.520 --> 16:30.980
They didn't keep a record.

327
16:31.480 --> 16:33.240
Is there any other way?

328
16:34.880 --> 16:36.280
Ask my ex-husband for it.

329
16:36.880 --> 16:38.160
Oh my God.

330
16:38.480 --> 16:39.400
This...

331
16:43.240 --> 16:44.120
Okay.

332
16:44.160 --> 16:45.040
Alright.

333
16:47.880 --> 16:48.640
Bad news.

334
16:49.280 --> 16:50.540
Son, did you hear that?

335
16:50.640 --> 16:53.680
I heard you. Ask your ex-husband for the divorce decree.

336
16:53.680 --> 16:55.410
Where's my bottle opener, Mom?

337
16:55.520 --> 16:56.650
In the first drawer.

338
16:59.400 --> 17:00.120
Son.

339
17:01.760 --> 17:02.480
Son.

340
17:04.160 --> 17:04.890
Have a peach.

341
17:06.280 --> 17:07.740
Here's what I'm thinking.

342
17:07.760 --> 17:10.160
If Li Guochen and I meet,

343
17:10.520 --> 17:12.319
it'll definitely be a disaster.

344
17:13.240 --> 17:14.160
Look.

345
17:14.160 --> 17:16.760
Can you help me talk to him about this?

346
17:17.000 --> 17:19.000
No, Mom. This is between the two of you.

347
17:19.000 --> 17:19.640
It's better if you

348
17:19.640 --> 17:20.970
communicate directly.

349
17:21.760 --> 17:22.359
Son.

350
17:22.359 --> 17:24.520
I know this is a hassle for you.

351
17:24.640 --> 17:26.160
But please help me out.

352
17:45.560 --> 17:47.920
Are you not busy at work today?

353
17:48.000 --> 17:49.520
It's okay. Not too busy.

354
17:55.640 --> 17:56.640
What's up?

355
18:00.760 --> 18:01.880
My mom is back.

356
18:04.880 --> 18:06.000
Doesn't your mom

357
18:07.000 --> 18:09.160
come back every year or two?

358
18:10.240 --> 18:10.920
Yes.

359
18:11.240 --> 18:14.640
But this time I need a favor from you.

360
18:15.240 --> 18:15.800
No.

361
18:19.920 --> 18:21.440
Hear me out first. I...

362
18:22.240 --> 18:24.800
My mom wants to apply for permanent residency,

363
18:24.800 --> 18:25.800
but she needs

364
18:25.920 --> 18:27.800
your divorce decree from back then.

365
18:27.800 --> 18:29.280
We each got a copy of the divorce decree.

366
18:29.280 --> 18:30.880
I tore mine up a long time ago.

367
18:32.440 --> 18:35.120
Can you just cooperate with her to get a replacement?

368
18:35.120 --> 18:36.920
I cooperated with her to get a divorce once.

369
18:36.920 --> 18:37.560
What?

370
18:37.560 --> 18:39.760
Do I have to cooperate with her to get a second divorce?

371
18:39.760 --> 18:42.040
It's simple this time. Just sign a paper.

372
18:43.880 --> 18:46.040
When we divorced, she said we'd never see each other again.

373
18:46.040 --> 18:47.570
Now she comes to me for help.

374
18:48.000 --> 18:49.040
I can't do it.

375
18:49.200 --> 18:49.880
No way.

376
18:50.520 --> 18:51.200
Okay.

377
18:51.760 --> 18:53.360
I'm just passing on a message for my mom.

378
18:53.360 --> 18:54.440
Think about it.

379
18:54.920 --> 18:57.880
Did you come today just for your mom's business?

380
18:58.760 --> 19:00.620
Then go back and tell Guo Chunling

381
19:00.840 --> 19:02.770
that I will never do her this favor.

382
19:24.720 --> 19:25.520
You're back.

383
19:28.800 --> 19:29.720
How is Zhao Jia?

384
19:30.440 --> 19:31.520
Do you even need to ask?

385
19:31.520 --> 19:32.780
Definitely not great.

386
19:33.760 --> 19:34.600
Let me ask you,

387
19:35.360 --> 19:36.280
did you already know

388
19:36.280 --> 19:38.040
about Cheng Fei's affair?

389
19:40.320 --> 19:42.280
From a legal perspective, he didn't cheat.

390
19:42.280 --> 19:43.360
What do you mean?

391
19:43.800 --> 19:45.860
Emotional cheating isn't cheating?

392
19:46.720 --> 19:47.560
Actually, if two people

393
19:47.560 --> 19:49.080
really can't get along,

394
19:49.920 --> 19:52.800
divorce is the best choice.

395
19:53.280 --> 19:56.360
Yes, divorce itself isn't the problem.

396
19:57.040 --> 19:58.440
Isn't the problem now

397
19:59.440 --> 20:01.600
that Cheng Fei actively betrayed the marriage?

398
20:01.600 --> 20:03.080
Our current roles

399
20:03.080 --> 20:04.120
are as their lawyers.

400
20:04.120 --> 20:06.380
We just need to protect their interests.

401
20:06.600 --> 20:08.800
Let's not judge their moral standards.

402
20:09.600 --> 20:10.280
Fine.

403
20:10.720 --> 20:13.380
Then how about this. Pass a message to Cheng Fei.

404
20:13.480 --> 20:15.600
Zhao Jia is determined to get the child.

405
20:15.600 --> 20:17.800
Alright. Pass a message to Zhao Jia too.

406
20:18.080 --> 20:20.680
Cheng Fei is determined to have this child too.

407
20:22.560 --> 20:24.000
He is the party at fault.

408
20:24.000 --> 20:26.040
What right does he have to fight for custody?

409
20:26.040 --> 20:28.800
Cheating does affect the court's

410
20:28.800 --> 20:30.360
judgment on marital fault.

411
20:30.400 --> 20:32.760
However, the custody ruling

412
20:33.320 --> 20:35.720
is mainly based on the best interests of the child,

413
20:35.720 --> 20:38.560
not solely on who is at fault in the marriage.

414
20:39.480 --> 20:41.280
The best interests of the child.

415
20:41.280 --> 20:43.080
The court will take into account

416
20:43.160 --> 20:45.000
who can provide a more stable

417
20:45.160 --> 20:47.000
and healthier living environment for the child.

418
20:47.000 --> 20:48.520
I raised Nuannuan.

419
20:49.800 --> 20:52.400
I have done much more for Nuannuan than she has.

420
20:53.800 --> 20:56.560
She doesn't even have time to spend with Nuannuan.

421
20:56.560 --> 20:58.820
I don't feel safe leaving her in her care.

422
21:00.280 --> 21:02.680
Once, she even caused Nuannuan to get hurt.

423
21:04.560 --> 21:05.760
When did this happen?

424
21:07.000 --> 21:07.840
I

425
21:07.840 --> 21:09.840
hate handling divorce cases the most.

426
21:09.840 --> 21:11.770
When two people first get married,

427
21:12.080 --> 21:13.960
they are so deeply in love.

428
21:14.280 --> 21:14.880
But when they divorce,

429
21:14.880 --> 21:16.810
they want to tear each other apart.

430
21:17.840 --> 21:19.200
The ugliness of human nature

431
21:19.200 --> 21:21.040
is fully exposed.

432
21:21.440 --> 21:24.040
It's one thing for adults to hurt each other,

433
21:24.040 --> 21:27.300
but in the end, it's often the children who suffer the most.

434
21:29.560 --> 21:31.680
I went through the bank statements completely

435
21:31.680 --> 21:33.080
and made a new discovery.

436
21:35.400 --> 21:36.840
At this time.

437
21:38.360 --> 21:39.880
Come and look at this.

438
21:54.200 --> 21:54.600
Cheng.

439
21:55.600 --> 21:57.330
We found a new piece of evidence

440
21:57.560 --> 21:59.090
that might be in your favor.

441
21:59.640 --> 22:00.600
In my favor?

442
22:08.160 --> 22:09.880
Next, the plaintiff and the defendant

443
22:09.880 --> 22:13.340
will present and cross-examine evidence regarding custody.

444
22:13.640 --> 22:14.300
Your Honor,

445
22:14.400 --> 22:15.080
Exhibit 1.

446
22:15.240 --> 22:17.520
These are the chat records of my client

447
22:17.520 --> 22:19.320
in the child's class parent group.

448
22:19.320 --> 22:21.120
From kindergarten to elementary school,

449
22:21.120 --> 22:22.240
it was entirely my client

450
22:22.240 --> 22:23.760
communicating alone,

451
22:23.800 --> 22:25.640
while the defendant had zero participation.

452
22:25.640 --> 22:26.400
I disagree.

453
22:26.400 --> 22:28.480
There is more than one way to participate in education.

454
22:28.480 --> 22:30.800
Providing financial support is also very important.

455
22:30.800 --> 22:32.880
Your Honor, these are the receipts

456
22:32.880 --> 22:35.520
for all the tuition fees paid by my client.

457
22:35.600 --> 22:36.400
Evidence Two.

458
22:36.880 --> 22:39.480
This is a photo of the child participating in a piano competition.

459
22:39.480 --> 22:42.160
My client was also the only one accompanying the child

460
22:42.160 --> 22:43.280
on such an important day,

461
22:43.280 --> 22:45.040
while the defendant was absent.

462
22:45.040 --> 22:46.280
So it can be understood that

463
22:46.280 --> 22:48.960
the defendant's attention to the child

464
22:49.040 --> 22:49.960
is insufficient.

465
22:49.960 --> 22:50.640
I disagree.

466
22:50.640 --> 22:53.000
These are the receipts for my client's purchase of the piano

467
22:53.000 --> 22:56.120
and the payment for piano lessons.

468
22:56.480 --> 22:58.200
If my client hadn't been

469
22:58.200 --> 22:59.960
working hard to earn money,

470
23:00.160 --> 23:00.960
I believe

471
23:01.480 --> 23:03.480
the child wouldn't have had this competition opportunity.

472
23:03.480 --> 23:05.720
Your Honor, the defendant has been using financial power

473
23:05.720 --> 23:06.960
to suppress my client.

474
23:06.960 --> 23:08.760
We just want to use these

475
23:08.760 --> 23:09.960
to prove one thing.

476
23:10.040 --> 23:12.800
The child's material foundation and educational level

477
23:12.800 --> 23:14.960
cannot plummet because of the divorce.

478
23:14.960 --> 23:17.600
Money can indeed make up for material losses.

479
23:17.840 --> 23:21.400
But the trust and affection

480
23:21.400 --> 23:24.060
accumulated through long-term companionship

481
23:24.160 --> 23:25.600
cannot be bought with money.

482
23:25.600 --> 23:26.600
Cannot be bought?

483
23:26.680 --> 23:28.280
What kind of emotion can compare to

484
23:28.280 --> 23:29.720
a mother's ten months of pregnancy

485
23:29.720 --> 23:31.400
and love for her child?

486
23:31.400 --> 23:33.360
I suffered so much to give birth to this child.

487
23:33.360 --> 23:34.760
What has he contributed?

488
23:35.560 --> 23:36.800
I'm sorry, Your Honor.

489
23:36.800 --> 23:39.080
The reason my client is so emotional

490
23:39.080 --> 23:40.880
is that she experienced dystocia

491
23:40.880 --> 23:42.010
during childbirth.

492
23:42.160 --> 23:44.840
The hospital issued two critical condition notices.

493
23:44.840 --> 23:46.680
She survived in the end,

494
23:46.680 --> 23:47.440
but

495
23:48.240 --> 23:49.640
she lost her fertility.

496
23:50.400 --> 23:53.280
She can only have this one child in her life.

497
23:54.720 --> 23:57.160
These are the hospital's critical condition notices,

498
23:57.160 --> 24:00.090
follow-up medical records, and emergency records.

499
24:00.280 --> 24:04.080
In addition, I would like to ask the court to take into consideration

500
24:04.080 --> 24:07.320
the plaintiff's admitted extramarital affair.

501
24:07.640 --> 24:10.760
Although emotional infidelity does not constitute a statutory fault,

502
24:10.760 --> 24:13.080
But it still violates the duty of loyalty

503
24:13.080 --> 24:14.080
in a marriage.

504
24:14.400 --> 24:15.240
Especially considering

505
24:15.240 --> 24:17.440
that the plaintiff is very likely to remarry, have more children,

506
24:17.440 --> 24:18.720
and start a new family.

507
24:19.080 --> 24:20.680
Therefore, we believe

508
24:20.680 --> 24:24.010
it is more appropriate for the child to stay with the mother.

509
24:32.520 --> 24:34.280
Two years ago, the child needed to take swimming lessons,

510
24:34.280 --> 24:36.400
and had to take a shower after class.

511
24:36.680 --> 24:37.800
And the women's shower room must be entered

512
24:37.800 --> 24:39.360
with the mother herself.

513
24:40.000 --> 24:42.680
But after making an appointment,

514
24:42.680 --> 24:43.800
the defendant failed to show up.

515
24:43.800 --> 24:45.280
So my client,

516
24:45.280 --> 24:46.520
having no other choice,

517
24:46.520 --> 24:49.960
let the child enter the women's shower room alone to wash up.

518
24:50.360 --> 24:52.720
As a result, an accident occurred during this process,

519
24:52.720 --> 24:54.320
leading to a fractured hand.

520
24:54.360 --> 24:56.440
An isolated accident

521
24:56.680 --> 24:58.200
cannot prove that my client

522
24:58.200 --> 24:59.720
was negligent.

523
24:59.720 --> 25:00.160
Your Honor,

524
25:00.160 --> 25:02.280
may I question the plaintiff directly?

525
25:02.280 --> 25:02.680
Objection.

526
25:02.680 --> 25:04.280
Overruled. You may proceed.

527
25:08.160 --> 25:08.800
Zhao Jia.

528
25:10.440 --> 25:13.400
Why were you so late that day?

529
25:17.680 --> 25:19.440
Well, I think

530
25:20.720 --> 25:22.360
I had an appointment with an out-of-town client,

531
25:22.360 --> 25:24.680
so I left late.

532
25:24.680 --> 25:26.160
Then I ran into a huge traffic jam,

533
25:26.160 --> 25:27.680
and we were discussing business.

534
25:27.680 --> 25:29.280
Is this out-of-town client

535
25:30.440 --> 25:31.440
surnamed Huang?

536
25:34.200 --> 25:34.960
Your Honor,

537
25:35.360 --> 25:38.400
I would like to submit an additional piece of evidence to the court.

538
25:38.400 --> 25:39.840
These are the defendant's bank statements.

539
25:39.840 --> 25:42.440
The date on it is August 4th, two years ago,

540
25:42.440 --> 25:44.680
which was the Qixi Festival of the year

541
25:44.680 --> 25:46.200
Nuannuan had the accident.

542
25:46.200 --> 25:47.000
And on that day,

543
25:47.000 --> 25:49.440
the defendant received a transfer from a man surnamed Huang

544
25:49.440 --> 25:52.360
in the amount of 1,314.

545
25:52.360 --> 25:54.520
I believe everyone understands

546
25:54.520 --> 25:55.600
the special meaning of this amount.

547
25:55.600 --> 25:56.680
And this man surnamed Huang

548
25:56.680 --> 25:59.720
did not just have a simple working relationship with the defendant.

549
25:59.720 --> 26:02.440
The defendant met this man two years ago

550
26:02.440 --> 26:04.440
and had an extramarital affair with him.

551
26:04.440 --> 26:06.600
And on the very day Nuannuan had the accident,

552
26:06.600 --> 26:09.400
it was because the two were on a date and lost track of time

553
26:09.400 --> 26:11.440
that the child had an accident.

554
26:11.440 --> 26:13.160
It's not like that.

555
26:13.160 --> 26:14.680
The hotel records are right there.

556
26:14.680 --> 26:15.720
Do you want to see them?

557
26:15.720 --> 26:16.960
Those... that...

558
26:17.080 --> 26:18.960
That day I was actually trying to...

559
26:18.960 --> 26:20.640
You still won't admit it even now.

560
26:20.640 --> 26:23.040
Plaintiff, please control your emotions.

561
26:23.120 --> 26:25.760
Given the facts ascertained by the court so far,

562
26:25.760 --> 26:28.120
Since the child is over eight years old,

563
26:28.360 --> 26:31.360
this court needs to seek the child's true wishes.

564
26:31.600 --> 26:33.480
After the plaintiff and defendant go back,

565
26:33.480 --> 26:35.920
please comfort the child psychologically.

566
26:35.920 --> 26:38.720
The court will notify you of the next hearing time.

567
26:39.120 --> 26:40.120
Court adjourned.

568
26:46.360 --> 26:47.000
Long.

569
26:47.680 --> 26:48.520
I'm sorry.

570
26:48.960 --> 26:51.360
I didn't mean to hide this from you.

571
26:51.440 --> 26:52.520
It's just that

572
26:53.280 --> 26:54.520
I couldn't say it.

573
26:54.520 --> 26:56.320
Zhao Jia, you didn't let me down.

574
26:56.360 --> 26:57.960
You let yourself down.

575
26:58.520 --> 26:59.720
By hiding this,

576
27:00.960 --> 27:03.020
you put us in such a passive position.

577
27:04.920 --> 27:07.520
I was under so much pressure at that time,

578
27:07.520 --> 27:09.520
and I had no way to relieve it.

579
27:09.600 --> 27:10.440
So I

580
27:11.080 --> 27:12.760
wanted to talk to Cheng Fei

581
27:12.760 --> 27:14.200
and let him listen to me.

582
27:14.200 --> 27:15.520
But before I could say a few words,

583
27:15.520 --> 27:17.160
he told me to change jobs.

584
27:17.160 --> 27:18.160
You know?

585
27:18.160 --> 27:20.160
He didn't want to understand me.

586
27:20.520 --> 27:23.720
I was confused for a moment,

587
27:24.000 --> 27:26.200
but I quickly cut off that relationship.

588
27:26.200 --> 27:26.720
That day,

589
27:26.720 --> 27:29.680
I was actually going to make it clear to that person.

590
27:30.280 --> 27:33.800
I didn't expect Nuannuan to have an accident.

591
27:34.680 --> 27:36.440
I regret it. I really...

592
27:37.440 --> 27:38.960
I really regret it.

593
27:40.880 --> 27:41.520
Long.

594
27:41.640 --> 27:43.400
That's all of it.

595
27:43.400 --> 27:45.530
I'm not hiding anything else from you.

596
27:45.920 --> 27:47.440
Please help me.

597
27:47.440 --> 27:49.440
I can give up the marriage,

598
27:50.880 --> 27:52.760
but I can't lose Nuannuan.

599
28:11.200 --> 28:11.960
Mom.

600
28:13.120 --> 28:15.450
Nuannuan, go inside and do your homework.

601
28:37.160 --> 28:38.760
What did you say to the child?

602
28:42.120 --> 28:42.760
I'm asking you a question.

603
28:42.760 --> 28:44.440
What did you say to the child?

604
28:47.240 --> 28:48.000
I'm warning you.

605
28:48.000 --> 28:49.860
Don't talk nonsense to the child.

606
28:50.000 --> 28:50.860
Did you hear me?

607
28:52.840 --> 28:53.400
Did you hear me?

608
28:53.400 --> 28:54.460
I'm talking to you.

609
28:56.840 --> 28:57.520
What do you mean?

610
28:57.520 --> 28:58.680
I'm talking to you.

611
29:34.440 --> 29:34.960
Son.

612
29:35.000 --> 29:37.320
Why didn't you answer when I called you so many times?

613
29:37.320 --> 29:39.360
The agent urged me today.

614
29:39.440 --> 29:40.770
What did Li Guochen say?

615
29:40.840 --> 29:41.560
My dad said

616
29:42.040 --> 29:42.680
he'll think about it.

617
29:42.680 --> 29:43.540
Think about it?

618
29:44.120 --> 29:45.320
Ridiculous.

619
29:45.320 --> 29:46.560
It's just signing a paper.

620
29:46.560 --> 29:48.240
It's neither against the rules nor illegal.

621
29:48.240 --> 29:50.080
What is there to think about?

622
29:51.720 --> 29:54.480
Does he think I should beg him?

623
29:55.760 --> 29:57.090
I have to take this call.

624
29:57.120 --> 29:57.800
No, you...

625
30:02.160 --> 30:02.760
Cheng Fei.

626
30:02.760 --> 30:04.800
Can you pick up Nuannuan tomorrow?

627
30:05.000 --> 30:06.320
Ask her what she wants.

628
30:07.240 --> 30:08.840
I'll talk to her teacher.

629
30:23.160 --> 30:24.280
What a coincidence.

630
30:24.280 --> 30:25.160
Zhao Jia didn't come?

631
30:25.160 --> 30:27.120
What about Cheng Fei? He didn't come either?

632
30:27.120 --> 30:27.720
No.

633
30:27.880 --> 30:29.280
They are quite in sync.

634
30:31.960 --> 30:32.800
Jindou.

635
30:34.200 --> 30:35.040
Nuannuan.

636
30:35.240 --> 30:35.960
Nuannuan.

637
30:36.120 --> 30:37.400
Aunt, Uncle.

638
30:37.600 --> 30:38.760
Mom and Dad are busy today.

639
30:38.760 --> 30:40.890
So we're picking you up. Are you happy?

640
30:43.840 --> 30:44.800
Thank you, teacher.

641
30:44.800 --> 30:45.640
No problem.

642
30:45.640 --> 30:46.760
I'll leave her to you then.

643
30:46.760 --> 30:47.490
Don't worry.

644
30:55.800 --> 30:57.120
What's wrong, Nuannuan?

645
30:57.120 --> 30:59.160
Are you not feeling well,

646
30:59.440 --> 31:01.520
or is the food not good?

647
31:03.800 --> 31:04.680
Then what is it?

648
31:08.400 --> 31:10.730
Will you guys always pick me up from now on?

649
31:14.160 --> 31:15.320
Of course not.

650
31:16.240 --> 31:18.960
Mom and Dad are just busy today.

651
31:18.960 --> 31:21.800
So they sent us to pick you up.

652
31:23.120 --> 31:24.280
Are my mom and dad

653
31:25.760 --> 31:27.320
getting a divorce?

654
31:37.920 --> 31:39.960
Why would you ask that, Nuannuan?

655
31:41.400 --> 31:43.040
I heard them arguing.

656
31:43.520 --> 31:46.050
And they don't sleep in the same room anymore.

657
31:46.440 --> 31:47.920
Nuannuan is growing up.

658
31:48.480 --> 31:50.410
Worrying about Mom and Dad, right?

659
31:52.200 --> 31:55.760
Is there any way to make them make up?

660
32:05.760 --> 32:08.440
This isn't something a kid should worry about.

661
32:09.160 --> 32:11.420
What a kid should worry about right now is

662
32:12.200 --> 32:13.480
whether you've finished your homework,

663
32:13.480 --> 32:13.960
right?

664
32:13.960 --> 32:15.160
Have you finished it?

665
32:16.120 --> 32:16.920
Not yet.

666
32:17.520 --> 32:18.560
Take it out and test me.

667
32:18.560 --> 32:20.120
Let's see if I can do it.

668
32:34.200 --> 32:36.930
Nuannuan is learning such difficult things now.

669
32:38.400 --> 32:39.680
I can't even do it.

670
32:46.120 --> 32:46.720
Come here.

671
32:48.040 --> 32:49.800
Nuannuan did her homework very well.

672
32:49.800 --> 32:51.720
Okay, say goodbye to your aunt.

673
32:51.800 --> 32:52.440
Bye-bye.

674
32:52.440 --> 32:53.520
And your uncle.

675
32:53.720 --> 32:54.480
Bye-bye.

676
32:58.440 --> 32:59.480
Nuannuan is back.

677
33:00.440 --> 33:01.560
It's time for your milk.

678
33:01.560 --> 33:02.720
Drink your milk.

679
33:02.720 --> 33:05.000
Didn't you just say you wanted orange juice?

680
33:05.000 --> 33:06.640
Mom will pour you some orange juice.

681
33:06.640 --> 33:07.480
Orange juice is too sweet.

682
33:07.480 --> 33:08.440
It's bad for your teeth.

683
33:08.440 --> 33:10.440
It's okay to drink it once in a while.

684
33:10.440 --> 33:12.000
Isn't that right, Nuannuan?

685
33:12.000 --> 33:13.760
We drink milk to grow tall.

686
33:15.160 --> 33:16.640
Mom just bought the orange juice today.

687
33:16.640 --> 33:18.080
Look, it's still cold.

688
33:18.080 --> 33:19.080
It's so hot today.

689
33:19.080 --> 33:20.540
Let's drink orange juice.

690
33:27.560 --> 33:29.360
When Nuannuan asked me just now,

691
33:30.040 --> 33:32.280
I really didn't know how to answer her.

692
33:32.520 --> 33:35.000
If I lied to her,

693
33:35.080 --> 33:36.720
that definitely wouldn't work.

694
33:36.720 --> 33:37.720
But I also felt

695
33:39.000 --> 33:41.060
I couldn't tell her the truth either.

696
33:42.040 --> 33:43.720
You know, when adults make mistakes

697
33:43.720 --> 33:46.450
and let such a young child bear the consequences,

698
33:46.520 --> 33:47.640
it's really cruel.

699
33:49.480 --> 33:51.610
Because a child's world is very small,

700
33:51.960 --> 33:52.960
so small

701
33:53.920 --> 33:55.920
that it can only hold their parents.

702
34:08.960 --> 34:09.800
Drink slowly.

703
34:15.040 --> 34:16.900
If you don't want to drink, don't.

704
34:34.080 --> 34:34.800
Nuannuan,

705
34:35.520 --> 34:36.520
I don't feel well.

706
34:53.239 --> 34:54.320
If you don't do live streaming,

707
34:54.320 --> 34:55.159
if you don't use the internet,

708
34:55.159 --> 34:56.440
you have no idea

709
34:56.440 --> 34:58.000
how many tricks there are

710
34:58.000 --> 34:59.080
in live streaming.

711
34:59.080 --> 35:01.520
Which of the things you do doesn't have a lot of tricks?

712
35:01.520 --> 35:02.160
Don't interrupt me.

713
35:02.160 --> 35:03.240
Let me finish.

714
35:04.040 --> 35:06.680
You have to build a persona for live streaming.

715
35:06.680 --> 35:09.800
What about your persona as a misguided old man?

716
35:09.920 --> 35:11.320
Isn't it natural? Do you still need to build it?

717
35:11.320 --> 35:13.080
What misguided old man?

718
35:13.320 --> 35:14.680
You haven't been to my live stream.

719
35:14.680 --> 35:16.240
I have so many fans.

720
35:16.800 --> 35:18.660
Why don't you open an account too?

721
35:18.800 --> 35:19.480
We can do a PK,

722
35:19.480 --> 35:20.440
and then we can gain fans for each other.

723
35:20.440 --> 35:21.040
You know?

724
35:21.120 --> 35:22.200
What would I interact with you about?

725
35:22.200 --> 35:23.240
Reenacting across the screen

726
35:23.240 --> 35:24.800
how I caught you back then?

727
35:25.240 --> 35:27.000
What's wrong with you?

728
35:28.000 --> 35:29.680
Since I walked into your house today,

729
35:29.680 --> 35:31.000
you've been attacking me

730
35:31.000 --> 35:31.960
with every few words.

731
35:31.960 --> 35:32.800
When did I attack you?

732
35:32.800 --> 35:34.160
I'm just upset.

733
35:34.800 --> 35:35.800
What are you upset about?

734
35:35.800 --> 35:36.800
The kids?

735
35:36.800 --> 35:38.320
What kids? Recently...

736
35:40.560 --> 35:41.640
The letter... the letter came back.

737
35:41.640 --> 35:42.700
Don't go. Don't go.

738
35:43.360 --> 35:44.420
What are you doing?

739
35:44.960 --> 35:47.160
Coming. My son is back.

740
35:50.840 --> 35:51.680
Chunling.

741
35:53.000 --> 35:54.080
Sorry.

742
35:54.840 --> 35:57.680
My name is Jennifer now.

743
36:00.840 --> 36:01.720
Jenni. Jenni.

744
36:03.560 --> 36:04.680
Please excuse us.

745
36:05.440 --> 36:07.800
I have private matters to discuss with him.

746
36:07.800 --> 36:08.640
Okay. Okay.

747
36:10.400 --> 36:12.330
I finally know why you're so upset.

748
36:12.480 --> 36:14.760
Okay, I'm leaving now, Jennifer.

749
36:23.800 --> 36:25.480
Why does my dad keep looking for you?

750
36:25.480 --> 36:26.640
He likes me.

751
36:28.800 --> 36:29.360
Godfather.

752
36:29.360 --> 36:30.080
Xin.

753
36:34.320 --> 36:36.040
I know you don't want to see me.

754
36:36.440 --> 36:38.040
I don't want to see you either.

755
36:38.040 --> 36:39.320
Then why are you here?

756
36:39.960 --> 36:41.490
Didn't you force me to come?

757
36:41.720 --> 36:42.680
Doing this

758
36:42.840 --> 36:44.680
makes it so hard for our son, caught in the middle.

759
36:44.680 --> 36:46.360
If our son is having a hard time,

760
36:46.360 --> 36:47.690
isn't it all your doing?

761
36:51.520 --> 36:52.160
Yes.

762
36:53.000 --> 36:54.320
This is my business.

763
36:54.960 --> 36:57.440
Then come to the court with me and sign the papers.

764
36:57.440 --> 36:58.440
From now on,

765
36:58.440 --> 37:00.440
I won't disturb your life, Deputy Director Li,

766
37:00.440 --> 37:01.680
and let you enjoy your old age in peace.

767
37:01.680 --> 37:02.440
I can't go.

768
37:02.440 --> 37:03.760
It's such a small thing.

769
37:03.760 --> 37:05.680
Why are you so selfish?

770
37:05.680 --> 37:06.560
Am I selfish?

771
37:06.560 --> 37:07.440
Selfish.

772
37:07.480 --> 37:09.160
So selfish you don't care about your family.

773
37:09.160 --> 37:10.160
After all these years,

774
37:10.160 --> 37:11.640
why haven't you changed at all?

775
37:11.640 --> 37:13.240
You haven't changed either.

776
37:13.320 --> 37:14.680
Still as aggressive as ever.

777
37:14.680 --> 37:15.920
Am I wrong?

778
37:16.040 --> 37:18.560
In the past, I asked you to do some business,

779
37:19.040 --> 37:19.840
but you absolutely refused.

780
37:19.840 --> 37:20.960
When asked why,

781
37:21.000 --> 37:22.480
you couldn't say a word.

782
37:22.680 --> 37:23.200
And you would often

783
37:23.200 --> 37:24.480
disappear from home for days.

784
37:24.480 --> 37:25.740
Enough, Guo Chunling.

785
37:25.960 --> 37:27.200
Stop bringing up the past.

786
37:27.200 --> 37:29.160
So what if I bring up the past?

787
37:29.160 --> 37:30.560
Look at you now,

788
37:30.560 --> 37:31.480
still living in this

789
37:31.480 --> 37:33.360
hexagonal room.

790
37:33.360 --> 37:34.960
Good thing I divorced you early.

791
37:34.960 --> 37:36.200
You just love money

792
37:36.200 --> 37:37.360
and vanity.

793
37:37.360 --> 37:39.160
Look how you led your son astray.

794
37:39.160 --> 37:41.480
Otherwise, would he be so distant from me now?

795
37:41.480 --> 37:42.680
That's because you didn't fulfill

796
37:42.680 --> 37:44.040
your responsibilities as a father.

797
37:44.040 --> 37:44.840
Did you?

798
37:44.840 --> 37:46.040
Of course I did.

799
37:46.320 --> 37:48.850
If I hadn't divorced you, my son would be dead.

800
37:53.320 --> 37:54.920
Did I want to harm my son?

801
37:54.920 --> 37:56.440
Think about what you did.

802
37:56.560 --> 37:57.400
You went abroad,

803
37:57.400 --> 37:58.600
started a new family,

804
37:58.640 --> 38:00.240
and left him alone back home.

805
38:00.440 --> 38:02.080
Li Guochen, how dare you accuse me?

806
38:02.080 --> 38:03.360
Don't point your finger at me.

807
38:03.360 --> 38:04.200
So what if I do?

808
38:04.200 --> 38:05.160
Are you trying to assault a police officer?

809
38:05.160 --> 38:06.480
Assault a police officer? So what if I assault you?

810
38:06.480 --> 38:06.920
Don't touch me.

811
38:06.920 --> 38:07.560
I'll touch you.

812
38:07.560 --> 38:08.480
What can you do to me?

813
38:08.480 --> 38:09.560
Arrest me?

814
38:30.320 --> 38:31.960
Why are you arguing again?

815
38:33.880 --> 38:35.520
I heard you from outside.

816
38:37.000 --> 38:38.320
Just like old times.

817
38:40.480 --> 38:41.480
You two

818
38:43.200 --> 38:45.200
always just stick to your own views

819
38:45.800 --> 38:47.330
and fight to the bitter end.

820
38:47.960 --> 38:49.690
You both say it's for my own good

821
38:50.200 --> 38:52.130
and that you're looking out for me.

822
38:52.520 --> 38:54.120
But what I really want

823
38:55.640 --> 38:56.900
and what I'm thinking,

824
38:59.000 --> 39:00.680
you've never cared about.

825
39:04.520 --> 39:06.120
Enough. I'm grown up now.

826
39:07.200 --> 39:08.200
Stop arguing.

827
39:11.200 --> 39:13.200
It's not easy for us to get together.

828
39:13.680 --> 39:16.480
Even though you two are no longer husband and wife,

829
39:17.320 --> 39:18.680
one is still my dad,

830
39:20.000 --> 39:21.600
and the other is still my mom.

831
39:49.160 --> 39:50.220
Throw the gun over,

832
39:50.240 --> 39:51.200
or I'll kill him.

833
39:53.200 --> 39:54.040
Listen to me.

834
39:55.120 --> 39:56.000
Let him go first

835
39:57.200 --> 39:58.000
and try to get leniency.

836
39:58.000 --> 39:59.040
Give me the gun.

837
39:59.320 --> 40:00.640
Is your gun more important,

838
40:00.640 --> 40:02.000
or is your son more important?

839
40:02.000 --> 40:02.680
You choose.

840
40:03.680 --> 40:04.600
Dad.

841
40:08.600 --> 40:09.480
Dad.

842
40:25.960 --> 40:30.120
Son, son.

843
40:30.640 --> 40:31.960
Son.

844
40:33.360 --> 40:34.920
Son.

845
40:39.000 --> 40:39.760
Divorce.

846
40:40.120 --> 40:41.320
Sign it right now.

847
40:42.000 --> 40:44.920
Chunling, this was really an accident.

848
40:44.920 --> 40:45.650
An accident?

849
40:46.680 --> 40:48.000
Look at our son.

850
40:48.000 --> 40:49.480
You almost killed him.

851
40:49.680 --> 40:50.680
I promise you.

852
40:51.480 --> 40:53.000
This will never happen again.

853
40:53.000 --> 40:54.130
How can you promise?

854
40:54.320 --> 40:55.680
You value this uniform

855
40:55.920 --> 40:57.880
more than your son's life.

856
41:00.960 --> 41:03.040
Li Guochen, say no more.

857
41:04.480 --> 41:05.610
Let's get a divorce.

858
41:06.120 --> 41:06.680
Fine.

859
41:07.000 --> 41:07.920
You can leave,

860
41:08.000 --> 41:09.260
but Xiaoxin must stay.

861
41:09.280 --> 41:12.000
Impossible. My son stays with me.

862
41:12.000 --> 41:12.800
Guo Chunling.

863
41:14.400 --> 41:15.280
I don't agree.

864
41:15.880 --> 41:16.520
Fine.

865
41:18.520 --> 41:20.580
Then let's see how the court decides.

866
41:51.080 --> 41:52.600
Plaintiff.

867
41:52.600 --> 41:53.400
Little boy,

868
41:53.480 --> 41:55.400
would you rather live with your dad

869
41:55.400 --> 41:57.400
or your mom?

870
42:38.160 --> 42:38.880
Here, here.

871
42:38.880 --> 42:39.880
Mom is here. Come.

872
42:40.560 --> 42:42.200
Here. Let's go.

873
42:46.280 --> 42:47.800
Oh my God, slow down.

874
42:47.960 --> 42:48.520
Okay, okay.

875
42:48.520 --> 42:50.080
Let's go. Alright.

876
42:51.120 --> 42:51.880
Miss.

877
42:52.360 --> 42:54.600
Where is Nuannuan? Hasn't she come out yet?

878
42:54.600 --> 42:55.480
In the afternoon,

879
42:55.480 --> 42:57.680
Nuannuan's father picked her up early.

880
42:57.680 --> 42:58.880
Didn't he tell you?
